#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/easymeshwizard.js:441
msgid ""
"All devices in the EasyMesh network will share the same <b>SSID</b> and MUST "
"operate on the same <b>Operating Frequency</b>.<br> On an EasyMesh Agent, "
"the SSID is auto-configured by the Controller after successful pairing."
msgstr ""
"All devices in the EasyMesh network will share the same <b>SSID</b> and MUST "
"operate on the same <b>Operating Frequency</b>.<br> On an EasyMesh Agent, "
"the SSID is auto-configured by the Controller after successful pairing."

#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/meshwizard.js:403
msgid ""
"All devices in the mesh must have the same <b>Mesh ID</b>, which is a "
"arbitrary string that identifies the mesh similar to an SSID."
msgstr ""
"All devices in the mesh must have the same <b>Mesh ID</b>, which is a "
"arbitrary string that identifies the mesh similar to an SSID."

#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/easymeshwizard.js:738
#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/meshwizard.js:735
