msgid "Almost there..."
msgstr "Almost there..."

#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/meshwizard.js:372
msgid ""
"An 802.11s <b>Mesh Gate</b> provides both a Mesh Point and a co-located non-"
"mesh network (e.g. an AP, an upstream Ethernet connection, etc.). It "
"broadcasts mesh gate announcements to help align the mesh nodes, making it "
"easier for traffic to reach the non-mesh network."
msgstr ""
"An 802.11s <b>Mesh Gate</b> provides both a Mesh Point and a co-located non-"
"mesh network (e.g. an AP, an upstream Ethernet connection, etc.). It "
"broadcasts mesh gate announcements to help align the mesh nodes, making it "
"easier for traffic to reach the non-mesh network."

#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/meshwizard.js:373
msgid "An 802.11s <b>Mesh Point</b> is a node in an 802.11s mesh network."
msgstr "An 802.11s <b>Mesh Point</b> is a node in an 802.11s mesh network."

#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/easymeshwizard.js:412
msgid ""
"An <b>EasyMesh Agent</b> is a logical entity that executes the commands "
"received from the Multi-AP Controller, and reports measurements and "
"capabilities data for fronthaul APs, clients and backhaul links to a Multi-"
"AP Controller and/or to other Multi-AP Agents."
msgstr ""
"An <b>EasyMesh Agent</b> is a logical entity that executes the commands "
"received from the Multi-AP Controller, and reports measurements and "
"capabilities data for fronthaul APs, clients and backhaul links to a Multi-"
"AP Controller and/or to other Multi-AP Agents."

#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/easymeshwizard.js:411
msgid ""
"An <b>EasyMesh Controller</b> is a Multi-AP device that is the primarily "
"responsible for managing the EasyMesh topology. It is capable of steering "
"weak clients to maintain a healthy network."
msgstr ""
"An <b>EasyMesh Controller</b> is a Multi-AP device that is the primarily "
"responsible for managing the EasyMesh topology. It is capable of steering "
"weak clients to maintain a healthy network."

