#: luci/luci-app-ekhwizards/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/wizard.js:361
msgid ""
"As with any Wi-Fi network, HaLow has <b>Clients</b> (also known as stations) "
"which discover and connect to an <b>Access Point</b>. If you select client, "
"non-HaLow devices can use the HaLow link by connecting to the other "
"interfaces."
msgstr ""
"As with any Wi-Fi network, HaLow has <b>Clients</b> (also known as stations) "
"which discover and connect to an <b>Access Point</b>. If you select client, "
"non-HaLow devices can use the HaLow link by connecting to the other "
"interfaces."

