"In <b>Router with Firewall</b> mode the HaLow connected devices obtain IP "
"addresses from the DHCP server on this device, and this device uses NAT to "
"forward IP traffic. The admin interface will be blocked on the network you "
"connect to, which is the normal behaviour for a home router. Choose this "
"when connecting directly to the internet."
